{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18726","headline":"省试观庆云图诗 · 柳宗元","name":"省试观庆云图诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"设色既成象，卿云示国都。\n九天开秘祉，百辟赞嘉谟。\n抱日依龙衮，非烟近御炉。\n高标连汗漫，逈望接虚无。\n裂素荣光发，舒华瑞色敷。\n恒将配尧德，垂庆代河图。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}